## 7. Backend API Surface

| Domain | Key Endpoints |
|--------|--------------|
| **Auth** | POST /register, /login, /refresh · GET /me · PATCH /me/personality |
| **Courses** | GET, POST / · POST /join · POST /batch · GET /{id} |
| **Topics** | CRUD on /courses/{id}/topics and /topics/{id} |
| **Resources** | Upload (file/text), GET/PUT/DELETE, reprocess-OCR |
| **AI** | Fact-check, pre-class research, study chat, test generate/submit/voice, attempt results |
| **Progress** | Start/end session, course/topic progress, streak, recommendations |
| **Invites** | Global class invites: create, join, list classmates |
| **WebSocket** | `/ws/{course_id}?token=...` — real-time resource processing status |

---

## 8. Frontend Structure

### Routes
| Route | Page |
|-------|------|
| `/login` | Email + password login |
| `/register` | Register + optional AI personality |
| `/courses` | All enrolled courses |
| `/courses/new` | Create course form |
| `/courses/join` | Join by invite code |
| `/courses/[courseId]` | Topic list with mastery bars |
| `/courses/[courseId]/topics/[topicId]` | Pre-class research + resources + AI chat |

### Zustand Stores
| Store | Manages |
|-------|---------|
| `auth` | User, login/register/logout (persisted) |
| `courses` | Course list, current course, topics |
| `resources` | Resources, upload, fact-checks |
| `aiChat` | Conversations, messages, RAG query |

### Key Components
- `GlassNav` — Navigation with course switcher, streak slot
- `ResourceCard` — Renders content (markdown), images, fact-check panel, delete
- `FileUpload` — Drag-and-drop with progress bar
- `AIChat` / `AIChatOverlay` — Floating study chat with conversation history
- `MarkdownRenderer` — Renders AI responses with proper formatting

---

## 9. Deployment & Infrastructure

```
VPS (Linux)
  └── Docker Compose
        ├── Next.js frontend (port 3000)
        ├── FastAPI backend (port 8000, Uvicorn)
        ├── PostgreSQL (pgvector extension)
        └── Redis
  └── Nginx reverse proxy → SSL, rate limiting
Cloudinary — file storage (PDFs, images, voice)
```

