## 11. Recommended Next Work Order (Frontend)

1. **Root `/` + auth guard** — redirect unauthenticated users to `/login`
2. **Progress UI** — streak in nav, mastery display from API
3. **Tests / Quiz UI** — generate → take → results (text + voice)
4. **Global Invites** — create/share class link, join by code
5. **Profile/Settings** — edit name + study personality
6. **WebSocket** — real-time "Processing…" / "Done" for resources
7. **Polish** — topic edit/delete, resource edit, reprocess OCR button
